Board-only suite: these trials exercise the ESP32-S3 stack budget (actor_memory_budget_plan.md items D and F): per-image sizing of main's stacks, actor and supervisor stacks that grow by heap chunks and are released by their stack_policy algorithm, a lowered reservation reached, and a thousand idle actors. Their goldens were derived on the board, and the hosted targets size stacks differently (reservations grown by pages), so the host integrate run skips this directory. Run it with make integrate TRIAL_TARGET=ESP32-S3_raw TRIAL_SUITES=stack_budget_board_addition from trials/.
